18. RO: Prin ce tranziţie de stare va trece un process când apelează pthread_cond_wait? Justificaţi răspunsul.
EN: What state transition will a process undergo when it calls pthread_cond_wait? Justify your answer.

The process will be in the WAIT state waiting for another thread to call pthread_cond_signal or broadcast, when it receives the broadcast, the process will be in the READY state and then eventually it will get into the RUNNING state.

